                  d="M10.304 39.984L0 22.064V18.536H2.576C4.144 18.536 5.50667 18.3493 6.664 17.976C7.82133 17.6027 8.75467 17.024 9.464 16.24C10.2106 15.4187 10.696 14.4107 10.92 13.216H0V9.296H10.864C10.64 8.13867 10.2106 7.168 9.576 6.38401C8.94133 5.6 8.10133 5.00267 7.056 4.59201C6.01067 4.144 4.74133 3.92 3.248 3.92H0V0H24.472V3.92H15.008C15.7546 4.62934 16.352 5.43201 16.8 6.32801C17.2853 7.18667 17.6026 8.17601 17.752 9.296H24.472V13.216H17.864C17.528 15.9413 16.464 18.088 14.672 19.656C12.9173 21.1867 10.6213 22.1947 7.784 22.68L18.648 39.984H10.304Z"
